==Battleground==
*5 [[The Thrillerz|Thrillerz]] spawn after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 1.67~3.33 seconds<sup>50f~100f</sup>.
*2 [[Zuche]]s spawn after 86.67 seconds<sup>2,600f</sup>, delay 1.67~3.33 seconds<sup>50f~100f</sup>.
*1 [[Dead Donny Dash]] spawns after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Ghost Doge]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Ghost Snache]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*2 [[Znache]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Zoge]]s spawn after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*7 [[Znache]]s spawn after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
*1 [[Lord Gravey]] spawns as the boss after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
It is very easy to rush the base down as, before Lord Gravey's spawn at 46.67 seconds, nothing will slow down your [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]].

This stage, although somewhat similar to the original [[Heavenly Tower/Floor 18|Floor 18]], should necessitate a very different strategy as the swapping of [[Dashing Face]] with Dead Donny Dash makes it much harder to gain money early on. Conserve your money and spend it only when necessary, as you don't get a lot of it here. [[:Category:Anti-Zombie Cats|Anti-Zombies Cats]] are helpful in this stage. For example, [[Welterweight Cat (Rare Cat)|Ectoweight Cat]] can help push back Lord Gravey when he gets close, and stop Donny from hitting your base with his Long Distance attack. Be careful of The Thrillerz and Zuches, as they can mess you up with their burrowing and subsequent powerful attacks. You should optimally not give them a chance to begin with. For obvious reasons, the [[Ototo Corps|Holy Blast]] is highly recommended due to the abundance of Zombies.

